Scope of this license and third-party material

The license above covers the code, the report and the result files written
for this evaluation.

The evaluation cases are derived from PGxQA
(https://github.com/KarlKeat/PGxQA, commit 0dfb974, MIT License). The file
data/pgxqa/drug_guidelines_for_pheno_queries.txt is copied unchanged from
PGxQA and remains under its license and copyright notice, reproduced in
data/pgxqa/LICENSE. The questions and expected recommendation texts in
cases.tsv, and the prompts in transcripts/, are taken from that file.

The recommendation texts in those cases originate from the guidelines of the
Clinical Pharmacogenetics Implementation Consortium (CPIC,
https://cpicpgx.org), as recorded by PGxQA.

The transcripts contain text generated by Claude models and, for the web
search arm, the titles and URLs of third-party pages; the content of those
pages is not included.
